---
source: crates/jailint/tests/rules.rs
---
error[almost_swapped]: this sets both `a` and `b` to `b`
  --> tests/lint/almost_swapped/bad.jai:12:5
   |
12 |     a = b;
   |     ^^^^^^
   |
help: to swap them, write `a, b = b, a;`
   |
11
12 ~     a, b = b, a;
13 -     b = a;
14       p: Pair;
   |
   = note: `almost_swapped` is `deny` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/almost_swapped

error[almost_swapped]: this sets both `p.first` and `p.second` to `p.second`
  --> tests/lint/almost_swapped/bad.jai:15:5
   |
15 |     p.first = p.second;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: to swap them, write `p.first, p.second = p.second, p.first;`
   |
14       p: Pair;
15 ~     p.first, p.second = p.second, p.first;
16 -     p.second = p.first;
17       print("% % %\n", a, b, p);
   |
   = note: `almost_swapped` is `deny` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/almost_swapped
